IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `vaa-protection`

-- Vulnerable Adults Act 2018, ss 2, 10, 11, 12, 13(6), 14, 15, 16, 18, 22(6), 9(4) and 23(2) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_vulnerable-adults-act-2018.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

